        "type": "reg",
        "input": "s = \"abac\"",
        "output": "[3, 1]",
        "expectedOutput": "[3, 1]",
        "explanation": "'a' occurs at index 0 and 2, so the first part must extend at least to index 2, giving the part \"aba\" (length 3), leaving \"c\" (length 1) as the second part"
      },
